 * BEGIN modulos/15-design-system/18-cleg-03b-rrhh-design-system-v2-2-integrado.php
 * Module: design_system
 * Target: 01-Snippets-Activos/18-cleg-03b-rrhh-design-system-v2-2-integrado.php
